# Only deterministic planning and approval; no generation job is launched.
name: Prepare and approve one context job under the investigation allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-picker
expect: g new
keys: g
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | generation-form
expect: set explicitly
expect: one attempt
ask: Does the form make its single repository-wide job, explicit allowance and draft-only result understandable before any model work?
keys: t
require-live-snap: 15 Total calls | total-editor
type: 5
keys: Enter r
require-live-snap: 15 Protected review | review-editor
type: 2
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 15 Protected review: 2 | limits-set
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | context-plan
expect: openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_generation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
ask: Does the prepared plan identify the model, source, resource limits and separate approval action without implying that generation started?
resize: 80x24
live-snap: generation-80
ask: Are the main action and allowance controls clear at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: generation-60
ask: Is context planning readable and navigable at 60x20?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: generation-40
ask: Does the smallest layout keep navigation and back controls visible?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: generation-40-last
ask: Can the operator reach the complete source, options and spending disclosure using the visible paging controls?
resize: 96x89
live-snap: generation-tall
ask: Does the tall layout retain useful hierarchy and complete readable terms?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 15 EXACT GENERATION OPTIONS | exact-options
expect: "activate": false
expect: "pipeline": "single"
ask: Are the exact options formatted clearly and distinct from the main plan summary?
keys: Tab
resize: 160x48
live-snap: generation-wide
ask: Is the wide view kept to a comfortable reading width?
resize: 40x12
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval-first
keys: y
require-live-snap: 15 Read remaining terms | approval-gated
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
ask: Does approval remain unavailable until all exact job and spending terms can be read?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved context job | approved-context
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_generation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
keys: Enter
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 20 L starts the approved jobs | job-ready
expect: a plan/allowance
ask: Does the approved job screen clearly separate approval from launch and make returning to context review discoverable?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | restored-context
expect: Open approved context job
expect: Total calls: 5
expect: Protected review: 2
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_generation.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
ask: Does restart without color preserve the exact context plan and allowance, with no implicit launch or context activation?
keys: Escape Escape Escape C-c
